  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Rockville, MD\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Rockville, MD\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nRockville, MD\nEmergency and Specialty\n301.637.3228\n1 Taft Ct.\nRockville, MD 20850\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\nMon-Thu: 24 hours\nFri: 7 am-2 am\nSat & Sun: 7 am-7 pm\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Rockville – in Metro DC.\nWe are located in Rockville, MD, serving the Washington D.C. metro area including Bethesda, Friendship Heights and Chevy Chase.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, we’re ready. If your pet has a condition that requires a specialist’s expertise, we’re ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nIf possible, call ahead and let our emergency vet know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nSpecialty Care: Our specialists work with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialty services are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Rockville.\nOur BluePearl Pet Hospital in Rockville is just 17 miles north of Washington D.C. Formerly called Hope Advanced Veterinary Center, our 33,000 square foot facility was built in 2014 and provides emergency care and a wide variety of specialty services to pets. Our hospital has two surgical suites and state-of-the-art diagnostic imaging capabilities, including laparoscopy, endoscopy and ultrasound.\nWe also offer a new oxygen administration technique for pets who need breathing assistance. High-flow nasal cannula (HFNC) provides unique benefits including:\nHigh flow rate of prescribed oxygen for effective breathing assistance\nHeated and humidified oxygen to benefit the respiratory tract health\nLess invasive option compared to mechanical ventilation, allowing the patient to remain awake during treatment\nSafe and effective oxygen delivery for patients who don’t need more intensive methods of oxygen support\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n301.637.3228\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n301.637.3228\n301.795.0145\n1 Taft Ct.\nRockville,\nMD                                    20850\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nWoodstock, MD\n10829 Birmingham Way\nWoodstock, MD 21163\n410.465.2428\n19.57 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nFrederick, MD\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick, MD 21701\n301.288.8387\n26.69 miles\nSkylos Sports Medicine\nFredrick, MD\n434 Prospect Blvd\nFrederick, MD 21701\n410.465.2428\n26.78 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
